'''Tommy''' is a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found in [[Snowhill]]. He sells exclusively [[Archer]] [[Jobs|Job]] [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*[[Drifting Archer Quiver]]
*[[Drifting Archer Leggings]]
*[[Drifting Archer Cap]]
*[[Drifting Archer Gloves]]
*[[Drifting Archer Boots]]
*[[Drifting Archer Hoodie]]
*[[Archer's Flair Shard of the Arctic]]
*[[Archer's Power Shard of Regeneration III]]
*[[Archer's Ring of Energy III]]
*[[Archer's Necklace of Bark Skin III]]
*[[Archer's Composite Bow of Flame]]
*[[Archer's Composite Bow of Stunning]]
*[[Archer's Composite Bow of Blizzards]]

==Trivia==
*Tommy was introduced in-game on August 6, 2013.
